  accept 6135

step Duskwing, Oh How I Hate Thee...
  when group 6135
  tip These are elite mobs: grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Duskwing is a level 60 elite: most classes solo it at level 62, but you may need help. Skip it if you are alone: the route has you grind the XP back.
  collect 15850 quest 6135.1 @26.1,59.0 map 1423 live

